pp-browser
Copyright 2026 PP Techs

This product includes software developed by PP Techs (https://github.com/pp-techs).

pp-browser is built on Camoufox (https://camoufox.com), a hardened Firefox fork, Playwright
(https://playwright.dev), Tauri (https://tauri.app), and other open-source packages listed in the
package manifests; their licenses are included in the distributed application.

The desktop app and CLI download the pinned Camoufox browser build and a Bun runtime binary
(https://bun.sh) on first use; these are separate programs started by the app, not linked into it,
and are not modified.
